<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 330 521" width="100%" style="max-width:330px;display:block;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;border-radius:10px" role="img"><text x="165.0" y="22.6" text-anchor="middle" font-size="17" font-weight="700" fill="#1e293b" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">丙酮酸的三条去路</text><text x="165.0" y="43.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14" font-weight="400" fill="#64748b" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">看有没有氧、看是什么细胞</text><rect x="15.0" y="58.0" width="146.5" height="90.0" rx="6" fill="#ccfbf1" stroke="#0f766e" stroke-width="1.3"/><text x="24.0" y="76.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="12.2" font-weight="700" fill="#0f766e" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">有氧 → 乙酰CoA</text><text x="24.0" y="93.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="11.2" font-weight="400" fill="#475569" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">丙酮酸脱氢酶复合体（</text><text x="24.0" y="108.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="11.2" font-weight="400" fill="#475569" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">需 5 个辅酶：TPP、</text><text x="24.0" y="123.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="11.2" font-weight="400" fill="#475569" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">硫辛酸、CoA、FAD、</text><text x="24.0" y="138.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="11.2" font-weight="400" fill="#475569" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">NAD⁺）→ 进三羧酸循环</text><rect x="168.5" y="58.0" width="146.5" height="90.0" rx="6" fill="#fef3c7" stroke="#b45309" stroke-width="1.3"/><text x="177.5" y="76.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="12.2" font-weight="700" fill="#b45309" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">无氧（肌）→ 乳酸</text><text x="177.5" y="93.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="11.2" font-weight="400" fill="#475569" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">乳酸脱氢酶，把 NADH 的</text><text x="177.5" y="108.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="11.2" font-weight="400" fill="#475569" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">氢交给丙酮酸，再生 NAD</text><text x="177.5" y="123.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="11.2" font-weight="400" fill="#475569" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">⁺ 使糖酵解继续</text><rect x="15.0" y="155.0" width="146.5" height="75.0" rx="6" fill="#dcfce7" stroke="#15803d" stroke-width="1.3"/><text x="24.0" y="173.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="12.2" font-weight="700" fill="#15803d" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">无氧（酵母）→ 乙醇</text><text x="24.0" y="190.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="11.2" font-weight="400" fill="#475569" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">丙酮酸脱羧酶（TPP）→ </text><text x="24.0" y="205.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="11.2" font-weight="400" fill="#475569" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">乙醛 → 乙醇脱氢酶 → 乙</text><text x="24.0" y="220.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="11.2" font-weight="400" fill="#475569" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">醇</text><rect x="168.5" y="155.0" width="146.5" height="75.0" rx="6" fill="#fee2e2" stroke="#b91c1c" stroke-width="1.3"/><text x="177.5" y="173.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="12.2" font-weight="700" fill="#b91c1c" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">糖异生 → 葡萄糖</text><text x="177.5" y="190.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="11.2" font-weight="400" fill="#475569" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">肝、肾：丙酮酸羧化酶 →</text><text x="177.5" y="205.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="11.2" font-weight="400" fill="#475569" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif"> PEPCK，绕过不可逆步骤</text><rect x="15.0" y="239.0" width="300.0" height="134.0" rx="7" fill="#fef3c7" stroke="#cbd5e1" stroke-width="1.4"/><text x="25.0" y="258.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="13.5" font-weight="700" fill="#b45309" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">乳酸循环（Cori 循环）为什么必须存在</text><text x="25.0" y="276.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="13.5" font-weight="400" fill="#b45309" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">· 肌糖原分解产生的乳酸不能自己变回糖（</text><text x="25.0" y="292.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="13.5" font-weight="400" fill="#b45309" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">肌缺葡糖-6-磷酸酶）</text><text x="25.0" y="308.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="13.5" font-weight="400" fill="#b45309" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">· 乳酸经血到肝 → 肝糖异生 → 葡萄糖回肌 </text><text x="25.0" y="324.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="13.5" font-weight="400" fill="#b45309" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">→ 肌再利用</text><text x="25.0" y="340.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="13.5" font-weight="400" fill="#b45309" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">· 代价：肝消耗 6 ATP 换 2 分子乳酸 → 净</text><text x="25.0" y="356.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="13.5" font-weight="400" fill="#b45309" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">耗能，但保住了肌肉继续糖酵解</text><rect x="15.0" y="381.0" width="300.0" height="76.0" rx="7" fill="#fee2e2" stroke="#b91c1c" stroke-width="1.2"/><text x="25.0" y="397.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="13.5" font-weight="700" fill="#b91c1c" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">丙酮酸脱氢酶复合体是「不可逆」的，</text><text x="25.0" y="413.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="13.5" font-weight="400" fill="#b91c1c" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">这也是「乙酰CoA 不能净合成糖」的根源</text><text x="25.0" y="429.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="13.5" font-weight="400" fill="#b91c1c" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">缺氧时乳酸堆积不是「代谢废物」，而是可被</text><text x="25.0" y="445.0" text-anchor="start" font-size="13.5" font-weight="400" fill="#b91c1c" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">肝再利用的燃料</text><rect x="11.0" y="462.0" width="308.0" height="51.0" rx="7" fill="#ccfbf1" stroke="#0f766e" stroke-width="1.2"/><text x="165.0" y="477.0" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13.5" font-weight="700" fill="#0f766e" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">有氧进线粒体、无氧留胞质成乳酸；乳酸循环让</text><text x="165.0" y="492.5" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13.5" font-weight="700" fill="#0f766e" font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">肌与肝分工接力</text></svg>